lass=\"view-role-top-wrap\"><h2 class=\"view-role-title role-linier\" data-w-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa5918b\" style=\"opacity:0\">Head of Research</h2></div><div class=\"view-role-wrap\"><div class=\"view-all-item-wrap\"><div class=\"role-top-flex-wrap\" data-w-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa59191\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"role-item-wrap\"><div class=\"role-item-title\">Company Name</div><div class=\"role-item-details\">Impax Recruitment</div></div><div class=\"role-item-wrap\"><div class=\"role-item-title\">Location</div><div class=\"role-item-details\">San Francisco</div></div><div class=\"role-item-wrap\"><div class=\"role-item-title\">Salary</div><div class=\"role-item-details\">$300k - $500k</div></div><div class=\"role-item-wrap\"><div class=\"role-item-title\">Available Position</div><div class=\"role-item-details\">Head of Research</div></div></div><div class=\"view-single-wrap\" data-w-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa591a6\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"role-item-title\">Work Type</div><div class=\"role-item-details\">Full Time</div></div><div class=\"job-description-wrap\" data-w-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa591ab\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"role-item-title\">Job Description</div><div class=\"job-all-details-wrap\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>We're partnered with a Series A startup, who are building large scale foundation models which build relationships between visual and textual data to predict and control the future of the real world.</p><p>They're building one of the most talent dense startup teams in the Bay, with engineers from top AI labs and foundation model startups.</p><p>If you have experience with at least one of the below, please apply:</p><ul role=\"list\"><li>Building foundation models/LLMs E2E (we don't care what focus, robotics, bio, self driving, chemistry etc... all welcome).</li><li>Large scale pre-training, in order of trillions of tokens.</li><li>Deep understanding of various model architectures, transformers, neural networks, diffusion, computer vision etc..</li><li>Large scale fine-tuning / post-training core models.</li></ul><p>What we can offer:</p><ul role=\"list\"><li>Relocation from anywhere in the world if the criteria is met.</li><li>IC work, with a technical leadership role to work directly with the founders to shape the research direction.</li><li>$300k - $500k base + significant equity.</li><li>No red tape/bureaucracy - get things done mentality.</li></ul><p>\u200d</p></div></div></div><div class=\"job-description-wrap mg-48\" data-w-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa591b9\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"role-item-title\">Additional Information</div><div class=\"job-all-details-wrap\"><div class=\"role-item-details\"><div class=\"w-dyn-bind-empty w-richtext\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"view-divider-wrap\" data-w-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa591c7\" style=\"opacity:0\"></div><div class=\"apply-now-title\" data-w-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa591c8\" style=\"opacity:0\">Apply Now</div><div class=\"apply-form-wrap w-form\" data-w-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa591ca\" style=\"opacity:0\"><form class=\"role-apply-form\" data-name=\"Email Form\" data-wf-element-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa591cb\" data-wf-page-id=\"6875ede13b9abef360d29de6\" id=\"Apply-Form\" method=\"get\" name=\"email-form\"><div class=\"form-field-cv-wrap\"><div class=\"form-all-content-wrap\"><div class=\"apply-single-wrapper\" data-w-id=\"1f897cb0-355b-7f7c-3470-a01edfa591ce\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"apply-single-wrap\"><label class=\"apply-text-label\" for=\"Name\">First Name</label><input class=\"apply-text-field w-input\" data-name=\"Name\" id=\"Name\" maxlength=\"256\" name=\"Name\" placeholder=\"ex. chris \" type=\"text\"/></div><div class=\"apply-single-wrap\"><label class=\"apply-text-label\" for=\"Last-Name\">Last Name</label><input class=\"apply-text-field w-input\" data-name=\"Last Name\" id=\"Last-Name\" maxlen